   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three days ago",
     "texto": [
      "**Há três dias** means «three days ago». It is used for the time that has passed since something started: **Tenho febre há três dias** (I have had a fever for three days).",
      "Watch out: here **há** means «ago». With another meaning, **há** can also mean «there is» (lesson 4)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Since when",
     "texto": [
      "**Desde quando** (since when) and **desde ontem** (since yesterday). It is used with the present: **Estou doente desde ontem** (I have been ill since yesterday).",
      "In Portugal **há dois dias** (two days ago) is also used in this function: **Estou doente há dois dias**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
